#. Glossary term label: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/v0/ns#glossary/gdhcn/verifiable-digital-health-certificate
#: glossary/gdhcn.glossary.json:155
msgid "Verifiable Digital Health Certificate"
msgstr "可验证数字健康证书"
